target/
# Local, uncommitted: points the git `room-host` dependency at a local VTI checkout for
# offline runs of the `harness` feature (see README).
.cargo/
# Not committed yet: a lock produced here has path-patched VTI crates in it, which is wrong for
# everyone else. Once one is generated with network and no `.cargo/config.toml` override
# (`cargo generate-lockfile`), delete this line and commit it (README, "Cargo.lock").
/Cargo.lock
# The room-host harness package has a placeholder git dependency, so its lock stays local.
/harness/Cargo.lock
# Link state, secrets and sealed files from local runs
data/
*.sealed
*.armor
setup-key*
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~

# Geb's own (not redistributed) test vector files, looked up by the vector tests when present
